OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors to rule on more London
OL,4,AStadium concerts
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors are to decide whether
OL,7,FLondon Stadium can more than double the
OL,8,Fnumber of concerts it hosts each year.
OL,10,FThe venue's operator wants to change
OL,11,Fits planning permission to allow up to
OL,12,F24 non-sporting events a year, up from
OL,13,F10, as it tries to cut annual losses of
OL,14,Fabout #19m.
OL,16,FIt puts the losses down to the
OL,17,Flong-term deal signed with West Ham
OL,18,Fover the use of the stadium in
OL,19,FStratford, east London. It also says
OL,20,Fthe current limits leave it unable to
OL,21,Fcompete with Wembley Stadium and
OL,22,FTottenham Hotspur Stadium.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
