OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors to rule on more London
OL,4,AStadium concerts
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewham Council planning officers have
OL,7,Frecommended the plans be approved,
OL,8,Fsaying they would support the borough's
OL,9,Ftourist economy.
